Compatibility fixes for MSVC 14.42 (VS 2022 17.12), which cannot compile some C++ constructs
used by iceberg-cpp 0.4.0. No functional change.
Library-source part of https://github.com/apache/iceberg-cpp/pull/986. Drop this patch once a release contains it.

